半分こしてドキっと思いも誰かと一緒じゃありませんの
Sharing it half and half, a pounding heart and thoughts

23
00:05:25,871 --> 00:05:29,811
友達以上になっちゃいたいのに
I want to become more than just friends

24
00:05:29,991 --> 00:05:32,491
押しても引いてもなびきませんのよ
Pushing or pulling, it just won't go my way

25
00:05:33,231 --> 00:05:36,201
例えば私好きになっちゃえば?
For example, if I were to fall in love with you?

26
00:05:36,201 --> 00:05:39,121
例外答えも簡単でしょ!ね?
An exception's answer is simple too, right? Right?

27
