乙女心変わる秋の空
A maiden's heart shifts like the autumn sky

31
00:05:49,201 --> 00:05:52,571
振り向かなきゃうんと後悔しちゃうんだから
If I don't look back, I know I'll regret it later

32
00:05:52,571 --> 00:05:55,341
キミが誰かに褒められてる
You're being praised by someone else

33
00:05:55,521 --> 00:05:58,271
勝手に喜ぶ私ですが
And I'm happy about it on my own, but...

34
00:05:58,561 --> 00:06:00,681
その“誰か”はね…
That "someone else"...

35
