きょうから私好きになっちゃえば?
From today onwards, if I were to fall in love with you?

41
00:06:20,151 --> 00:06:23,121
妄想たみには必要でしょ!ね?
That's definitely necessary in fantasies, right?

42
00:06:23,281 --> 00:06:25,551
恋って病だよ
Love is just an illness

43
00:06:26,341 --> 00:06:27,431
初恋は楽しんでいたけれど
My first love was fun, or so I thought,

44
00:06:28,031 --> 00:06:31,431
そんなの嘘つらくて涙ばかりだった
but those were all just lies and heartbreak

45
00:06:31,641 --> 00:06:36,441
でもね好きって気づけた時は嬉しかったんだ
Even so, I fell in love, and when I realized it,

46
00:06:41,341 --> 00:06:42,601
半分こして好きって思いも一人じゃ重くて持てませんのよ
Sharing it half and half, "I love you" is too heavy to bear alone

47
